{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00914","headline":"横吹曲辞 陇头 · 张籍","name":"横吹曲辞 陇头","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇头已断人不行，胡骑夜入凉州城。\n汉家处处格鬬死，一朝尽没陇西地。\n驱我边人胡中去，散放牛羊食禾黍。\n去年中国养子孙，今着毡裘学胡语。\n谁能更使李轻车，收取凉州属汉家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}